# CloudFormation
AWS infrastructure ko code se automatically banane wala AWS ka IaC tool.

AWS CloudFormation ek Infrastructure as Code (IaC) service hai.
Iska use AWS resources (EC2, S3, VPC, RDS, IAM, etc.) ko code likhkar automatically create aur manage karne ke liye hota hai.

> Kyun use hota hai?
Maan lo tumhe create karna hai:
EC2
VPC
S3 Bucket
RDS Database
Without CloudFormation ❌
AWS Console me login
Har resource manually create
Time zyada lagega
Galti hone ke chances zyada
With CloudFormation ✅
Ek template likho aur run karo.
AWS sab resources automatically create kar dega.

> CloudFormation se kya-kya create kar sakte ho?
✅ EC2 → Virtual server create karne ke liye.
✅ S3 Bucket → Files (images, videos, documents, backups) store karne ke liye.
✅ VPC → Secure private network banane ke liye.
✅ RDS → Database (MySQL, PostgreSQL, etc.) create karne ke liye.
✅ IAM → Users aur permissions manage karne ke liye.
✅ Lambda → Server manage kiye bina code run karne ke liye.
✅ Load Balancer → Traffic ko multiple servers me distribute karne ke liye.
✅ Auto Scaling → Traffic ke hisaab se servers automatically badhane ya kam karne ke liye.
✅ CloudFront → Website aur files ko duniya bhar me fast deliver karne ke liye.

# CloudFormation (IaC)
CloudFormation is an AWS service that lets you create, manage, and update AWS infrastructure using code (templates) instead of manually creating resources in the AWS Console.

What is Infrastructure as Code (IaC)?
Infrastructure as Code (IaC) means defining infrastructure (servers, databases, networks, storage, etc.) in a code file so it can be created automatically.

Instead of:
Login to AWS Console
Create EC2
Create S3
Configure VPC
Attach Security Group

You simply write a template and AWS creates everything automatically.
> Why Use CloudFormation?
✅ Automates infrastructure deployment
✅ Saves time
✅ Reduces manual errors
✅ Version control with Git
✅ Easy to recreate environments

> Kya create kar sakta hai?
💻 EC2 → Virtual Server
📁 S3 → Storage
🌐 VPC → Network
🗄️ RDS → Database
🔐 IAM → Security & Permissions
⚡ Lambda → Serverless Code
⚖️ Load Balancer → Traffic Distribution
📈 Auto Scaling → Automatically Servers Increase/Decrease
🚀 CloudFront → Fast Content Delivery

# Terraform(Iac)
Terraform ek Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tool hai.

Iska use AWS, Azure, Google Cloud (GCP) aur dusre cloud platforms par infrastructure ko code se automatically create aur manage karne ke liye hota hai.

# Ansible
Ansible ek Automation aur Configuration Management Tool hai.

Iska use servers ko automatically configure karne, software install karne aur applications deploy karne ke liye hota hai.

Simple Definition: Ansible ek automation tool hai jo servers par configuration aur deployment automatically karta hai.

Kyun use hota hai?
Maan lo tumhare paas 100 servers hain.

Without Ansible ❌:
Har server par login karo.
Java install karo.
Docker install karo.
Nginx install karo.

Bahut time lagega.

With Ansible ✅
Ek playbook likho.
Ek command run karo.
Sabhi 100 servers par automatically install ho jayega.


